# Performance

- Server Components and streaming over client waterfalls.
- Product images via Cloudinary / `next/image`. No unoptimized full-resolution heroes.
- Do not install animation or 3D libraries beyond Motion.
- Search stays in Postgres (`pg_trgm` + FTS) until a later phase names Typesense/Algolia.
- Avoid huge client bundles on PDP and checkout. Keep drawers isolated.
- Cache catalogue reads where stale-while-revalidate is safe; never cache authenticated carts, quotes, or payment state as public.
